      "chunk_sequence": 3,
      "text": "Design research is research conducted in the field of design. Obviously. But what exactly do we mean by 'research' and what do we mean by 'design'? Each of the two words taken singly represents a process mysterious enough in itself, so plain men can be forgiven for flinching at their combination, Does the expression mean research into design? Or research for the purposes of design? Or a sort of archeology of design? And is it about designed objects? Or about the qualities which may be seen in designed objects? Or about the procedures which give rise to designed objects? Or what?",
