      "text": "4. 2.1.\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ At a theoretical level, it is intended to further investigate the theory of adaptive teaching systems. A starting point in this area is GORDON PASK's \"The Cybernetics of Human Learning and Performance\" (1975). Dr. George Mallen, Deputy Head of Research in the Department of Design Research, has had extensive experience in this area working with Professor Pask during the late sixties, and has agreed to act as consultant to the team.",
